  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Swedesurvey is involved in several projects within the field of land surveying in North Western Russia. Most of the projects are to enter into their third phase. In order to make thorough project preparationsSwedesurvey and the Russian parties shall carry out a project planningusing the LFA-approach.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Swedesurvey &#xe4;r involverad i flera projekt inom lantm&#xe4;teri i nordv&#xe4;straRyssland. De flesta projekten &#xe4;r i st&#xe5;nd att b&#xf6;rja sin tredje fas. Medm&#xe5;l att g&#xf6;ra noggranna projektf&#xf6;rberedelser skall Swedesurvey och de ryska parterna utf&#xf6;ra en projektplanering med hj&#xe4;lp av den Sida- till&#xe4;mpande LFA-metoden.</narrative>
  </description>
